  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 220°C. Toss the sweet potato with 2 tbsp oil, the paprika and cumin, then roast for 25–30 minutes until caramelised, turning once.",
    "Warm the remaining oil in a pan, add the garlic and the drained black beans, and cook for 5 minutes, lightly crushing some with a fork.",
    "Toss the shredded cabbage with the lime juice and a pinch of salt to make a quick slaw.",
    "Warm the tortillas in a dry pan until soft and pliable.",
    "Build each taco with beans, roasted sweet potato, slaw, sliced avocado and plenty of coriander."
  ],
  "notes": "A drizzle of chipotle-spiked vegan mayo takes these over the top. The roasted sweet potato keeps for three days for easy lunches."
}
